        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Local coding agents can be built using open-weight models.",
            "These agents are positioned as an alternative to proprietary AI solutions, including Claude Code and Codex subscriptions.",
            "The approach allows for giving coding agents a memory that users own."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "本地代码代理可利用开源模型构建。",
            "这些代理被定位为专有AI解决方案的替代品，包括Claude Code和Codex订阅。",
            "该方法允许为代码代理提供用户拥有的内存功能。"
          ]
